OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested in counter-terror
OL,4,Aswoop, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof terrorism offences after a major
OL,8,Fpolice swoop in Manchester's Northern
OL,9,FQuarter.
OL,11,FThe pair were held in Newton Street at
OL,12,F14:45 BST on Sunday as part of an
OL,13,Fongoing operation. They remain in
OL,14,Fcustody.
OL,16,FPolice said a property on Epworth
OL,17,FStreet in Liverpool had been searched
OL,18,Fas well as one on Lancaster Road in
OL,19,FSalford.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
